 "description": "Giordano2020 - SIDARTHE model of COVID-19 spread in Italy\nBioModels BIOMD0000000955 (curated). SBML file: Giordano2020.xml.\nSimulation: 0 to 360 time units (SED-ML: Giordano2020.sedml), sampling 0.3333333333333333.\nRun switches: -ig:mass -INT:5 -obeymaxint\nVerification against libRoadRunner (SBML reference): PASS, max |difference| = 5.07e-04 of species peak (worst: Diagnosed)\nSBML time units are used unchanged as Kintecus seconds.\nConversion notes:\n  [info] time event(s) on 'alpha' encoded as time/value pairs in EV_P_ALPHA.TXT (SET)\n  [info] time event(s) on 'beta' encoded as time/value pairs in EV_P_BETA.TXT (SET)\n  [info] time event(s) on 'gamma' encoded as time/value pairs in EV_P_GAMMA.TXT (SET)\n  [info] time event(s) on 'delta' encoded as time/value pairs in EV_P_DELTA.TXT (SET)\n  [info] time event(s) on 'epsilon' encoded as time/value pairs in EV_P_EPSILON.TXT (SET)\n  [info] time event(s) on 'mu' encoded as time/value pairs in EV_P_MU.TXT (SET)\n  [info] time event(s) on 'nu' encoded as time/value pairs in EV_P_NU.TXT (SET)\n  [info] time event(s) on 'lambda' encoded as time/value pairs in EV_P_LAMBDA.TXT (SET)\n  [info] time event(s) on 'rho' encoded as time/value pairs in EV_P_RHO.TXT (SET)\n  [info] time event(s) on 'kappa' encoded as time/value pairs in EV_P_KAPPA.TXT (SET)\n  [info] time event(s) on 'xi' encoded as time/value pairs in EV_P_XI.TXT (SET)\n  [info] time event(s) on 'sigma' encoded as time/value pairs in EV_P_SIGMA.TXT (SET)\n  [info] time event(s) on 'zeta' encoded as time/value pairs in EV_P_ZETA.TXT (SET)\n  [info] time event(s) on 'eta' encoded as time/value pairs in EV_P_ETA.TXT (SET)\n  [partial] 14 profile files exceed the GUI's 10 O_ file limit\nRenamed species (Kintecus name = SBML id): p_alpha = alpha; p_beta = beta; p_gamma = gamma; p_delta = delta; p_epsilon = epsilon; p_zeta = zeta; p_eta = eta; p_mu = mu; p_nu = nu; p_lambda = lambda; p_kappa = kappa; p_rho = rho; p_sigma = sigma; p_xi = xi",
